Components under other licenses
-------------------------------

The upsided binary links the following Go modules, which are licensed under
the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3 (LGPL-3.0). Their source
code is available at the listed locations; the exact versions are pinned in
go.mod and go.sum.

  - Ethermint, fork maintained by Crypto.org:
    https://github.com/crypto-org-chain/ethermint
  - go-ethereum library packages, fork maintained by Crypto.org:
    https://github.com/crypto-org-chain/go-ethereum

The contracts/ directory includes Solidity libraries from DappHub
(ds-token, ds-auth, ds-test), Copyright (C) 2015, 2016, 2017 DappHub, LLC,
licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later (GPL-3.0).
Each file keeps its own license header.

The contracts in contracts/src/ModuleCRC20.sol and contracts/src/ModuleCRC21.sol
extend ds-token. Their compiled bytecode is embedded in the upsided binary
(x/upside/types/contracts/ModuleCRC20.json and ModuleCRC21.json), so the binary
contains code built from GPL-3.0 sources. The full source of these contracts
and of ds-token is in this repository.

Other dependencies are listed in go.mod and keep their own licenses,
including the Cosmos SDK and CometBFT (Apache License 2.0) and ibc-go (MIT).
